<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">In the profiles</h2><ul class="yr-prof"><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/canada"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Canada.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Canada</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Newfoundland joins Canada as the tenth province</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/republic-of-china"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Republic%20of%20China.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Republic of China</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Defeated in the civil war, the government moves to Taipei</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/peoples-republic-of-china"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/People's%20Republic%20of%20China.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>People's Republic of China</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Mao Zedong proclaims the People’s Republic in Beijing on 1 October</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/free-hanseatic-city-of-bremen"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Free%20Hanseatic%20City%20of%20Bremen.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Free Hanseatic City of Bremen</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Bremen becomes a state of the Federal Republic of Germany</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/free-and-hanseatic-city-of-hamburg"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Free%20and%20Hanseatic%20City%20of%20Hamburg.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Free and Hanseatic City of Hamburg</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Hamburg becomes a state of the Federal Republic of Germany</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/kingdom-of-the-netherlands"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Kingdom%20of%20the%20Netherlands.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Kingdom of the Netherlands</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Sovereignty over Indonesia is transferred to the new Indonesian state</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/dutch-east-indies"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Dutch%20East%20Indies.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Dutch East Indies</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Netherlands transfers sovereignty to Indonesia on 27 December</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/indonesia"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Indonesia.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Indonesia</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Netherlands transfers sovereignty after the Round Table Conference at The Hague</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/united-state-of-rajasthan"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/United%20State%20of%20Rajasthan.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>United State of Rajasthan</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Jaipur, Jodhpur, Bikaner and Jaisalmer join to form Greater Rajasthan (30 March)</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/united-state-of-rajasthan"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/United%20State%20of%20Rajasthan.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>United State of Rajasthan</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Matsya Union of Alwar, Bharatpur, Dholpur and Karauli joins (15 May)</span></li></ul></section>
